node_modules
dist
# Never bake local secrets into the web image (issue #308): Vite loads
# .env* files at build time, so any canary/secret file left in the build
# context would bake straight into the bundle layers.
.env
.env.local
.env.production
.env*
**/.env
**/.env.*
# .NET user-secrets / ad-hoc secret files must never enter the context.
**/secrets.json
**/*.secrets.json
*.md
